# Repository reading rules

Do NOT read, inspect, search, summarize, or include the contents of these directories
unless the user explicitly asks for them:

- .git/
- node_modules/
- bin/
- obj/
- .next/
- dist/
- out/
- coverage/
- logs/
- tmp/
- temp/
- .vscode/
- .idea/

Do NOT read or include these files unless the user explicitly asks:

- .env
- .env.*
- appsettings.Development.json
- appsettings.Local.json
- *.log

Never expose API keys, passwords, connection strings, access tokens,
JWT secrets, database credentials, or other secrets in responses.

When working on the ASP.NET Core API, prefer reading only:

- GbAccount.Api/Controllers/
- GbAccount.Api/DTOs/
- GbAccount.Api/Data/
- GbAccount.Api/Interfaces/
- GbAccount.Api/Services/
- GbAccount.Api/Mapping/
- GbAccount.Api/Models/
- GbAccount.Api/Program.cs

When working on the Next.js frontend, prefer reading only:

- src/
- public/

Only inspect additional files when they are directly required for the
current task or the user explicitly requests them.